WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.810
Hi! Where's the cat? In the box, on the box, or under the box? Today we'll learn position words.

2
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.482
In means inside: The cat is in the box.

3
00:00:13.632 --> 00:00:17.466
On means on top and touching: The book is on the table.

4
00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:21.378
Under means below: The ball is under the chair.

5
00:00:21.528 --> 00:00:26.706
Behind means at the back; next to means beside.

6
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:29.466
Ask with: Where is the…?

7
00:00:29.616 --> 00:00:32.178
Answer: It is under the bed.

8
00:00:32.328 --> 00:00:35.538
Next to is always two words together.

9
00:00:35.688 --> 00:00:41.058
A preposition is often followed by the: on the desk.

10
00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:45.690
Watch out! The fish is inside the bowl, not on top!

11
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.162
Inside is in.

12
00:00:48.312 --> 00:00:52.578
So say: The fish is in the bowl.

13
00:00:52.728 --> 00:01:01.866
Your turn! The pen is inside the bag. Which word? Pause and think.

14
00:01:02.016 --> 00:01:06.666
Inside is in. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:16.242
Another one! The cup is on top of the table. Which word? Pause and think.

16
00:01:16.392 --> 00:01:21.570
On top and touching is on. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:31.050
Here's another! The dog is below the bed. Which word? Pause and think.

18
00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:35.826
Below is under. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:35.976 --> 00:01:45.354
Try one more! Ali sits beside Mei. Which words? Pause and think.

20
00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:50.490
Beside is next to. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:50.640 --> 00:02:00.330
Try one more! The cat hides at the back of the door. Which word? Pause and think.

22
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.418
At the back is behind. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:05.568 --> 00:02:15.114
Try one more! The shoes are inside the box. Which word? Pause and think.

24
00:02:15.264 --> 00:02:19.914
Inside is in. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:20.064 --> 00:02:29.562
Try one more! The bird is on top of the roof. Which word? Pause and think.

26
00:02:29.712 --> 00:02:34.338
On top is on. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:34.488 --> 00:02:43.866
Try one more! The cat is on top of the bed. Which word? Pause and think.

28
00:02:44.016 --> 00:02:48.642
On top is on. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:48.792 --> 00:02:58.025
Last one! My bag is below the chair. Which word? Pause and think.

30
00:02:58.175 --> 00:03:02.801
Below is under. Did you get it right?

31
00:03:02.951 --> 00:03:10.433
Remember: in is inside, on is on top, under is below, behind is at the back, next to is beside.

32
00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:15.353
Put a toy in different places and say where it is!

